  "fr": "La-la-la, hm-hmm..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "Hm, hm, hmm...",
  "fr": "Hm, hm, hmm..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Richemont",
  "fr": "&Richemont"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richemont",
  "en": "Dauphin.",
  "fr": "Dauphin."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "Hm, hm, la-la-laa!",
  "fr": "Hm, hm, la-la-laa !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richemont",
  "en": "Dauphin!\nYour Royal Highness Charles!",
  "fr": "Dauphin !\nVotre Altesse royale Charles !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "Hmmeh?!",
  "fr": "Hmmeh ?!"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "...Ooh, you made me lose.",
  "fr": "...Oh, vous m'avez fait perdre."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "Richemont, MUST you flitter about\nlike that at my side?",
  "fr": "Richemont, faut-il VRAIMENT que vous\npapillonniez ainsi autour de moi ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richemont",
  "en": "...Dauphin. I presume you've\nheard the stories?",
  "fr": "...Dauphin. Vous avez entendu les\nrumeurs, je présume ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "Oh, yes. The little songbird\nchirping left and right about God?",
  "fr": "Oh, oui. Ce petit oiseau qui\npépie à tout va au sujet de Dieu ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "What? Was there more?",
  "fr": "Quoi ? Il y avait autre chose ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richemont",
  "en": "No, my dauphin, consider that\nbook closed.",
  "fr": "Non, mon dauphin, considérons\nl'affaire close."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richemont",
  "en": "Now we must talk tactics: your\nnext attack on Orléans.",
  "fr": "Parlons plutôt stratégie : votre\nprochain assaut sur Orléans."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "...Again?",
  "fr": "...Encore ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "You can spout all the tactics\nyou want,",
  "fr": "Vous pouvez débiter toutes les\nstratégies que vous voudrez,"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "but no victories will come of\nthem so long as I am just the\ndauphin.",
  "fr": "elles ne mèneront à aucune\nvictoire tant que je ne serai\nque le dauphin."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "",
  "en": "&Georges",
  "fr": "&Georges"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "Prethithely tho!",
  "fr": "Précizément !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "I thay we leaff the warring to\nthe \"thavior.\"",
  "fr": "Ze dis qu'il faut laizzer la\nguerre à la « zalvatrize »."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "Perhapth if the little virgin\nbird chirpth enough,",
  "fr": "Peut-être que zi le petit oizeau\nvierze pépie azzez fort,"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "an army of thheep and goatth\nwill gambol to her thide.",
  "fr": "une armée de moutons et de zèvres\nviendra gambader à zes côtés."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "Aha ha! I rather like that.",
  "fr": "Ha ha ! Voilà qui me plaît."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Richemont",
  "en": "Are you certain arranging an\naudience with the girl was wise?",
  "fr": "Êtes-vous certain qu'accorder une\naudience à cette fille soit sage ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "...Huh? Audience?",
  "fr": "...Hein ? Une audience ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "Why, thertainly!",
  "fr": "Mais zertainement !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "Robert of the Vaucouleurs\ngarrithon told me all about her.",
  "fr": "Robert, de la garnizon de\nVaucouleurs, m'a tout raconté."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "I've alwayth wanted to mock a\nmockingbird.",
  "fr": "Z'ai touzours voulu me moquer\nd'un oizeau moqueur."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Charles VII",
  "en": "You should have consulted me,\nGeorges...",
  "fr": "Vous auriez dû me consulter,\nGeorges..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "Hee-haw! Don't pretend you're\nnot pleathed.",
  "fr": "Hi-han ! Ne faites pas zemblant\nde ne pas être ravi."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "It wath you, dauphin, who wanted\na chanth to outthmart the\nwench...",
  "fr": "Z'est vous, dauphin, qui vouliez\nune occazion de ridiculizer\ncette donzelle..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "Wath it not?",
  "fr": "N'est-ze pas ?"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1050AB",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Georges",
  "en": "And I know jutht the way.\nLithen clothely...",
  "fr": "Et ze connais zuztement le moyen.\nÉcoutez bien..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Colet",
  "en": "Zees should be far enough.",
  "fr": "Ici, nous devrions être assez loin."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Colet",
  "en": "You know, seester, you put up a \nbwave fight...",
  "fr": "Tu sais, ma chère, tu t'es battue\navec bravoure..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Colet",
  "en": "considering you were hopelessly \noutclassed.\fI teep my hat in your general \ndirection.",
  "fr": "même si tu étais complètement\ndépassée.\fJe te tire mon chapeau... enfin,\ndans ta direction générale."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Marcel",
  "en": "You were amazing, Jeannette!\nI thought we were all goners.",
  "fr": "Tu as été incroyable, Jeannette !\nJ'ai cru qu'on était tous perdus."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Marcel",
  "en": "But then you started fighting,",
  "fr": "Mais quand tu t'es mise à combattre,"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Marcel",
  "en": "and it was just like an angel \nhad come down from heaven to \nsave us!",
  "fr": "c'était comme si un ange était\ndescendu du Ciel pour nous\nsauver !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Colet",
  "en": "Oh, why don't you lay eet on just \na leetle zeeker, mon ami? C'mere\\u2014",
  "fr": "Oh, tu ne veux pas en rajouter\nun peu, mon ami ? Viens là\\u2014"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Marcel",
  "en": "Ow hee hee, quit it!\nThat hurt, Colette!",
  "fr": "Hi hi hi, arrête !\nÇa fait mal, Colette !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Liane",
  "en": "J-Jeanne...\nOver th-there...",
  "fr": "J-Jeanne... L-là-bas..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Him again!",
  "fr": "Encore lui !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Colet",
  "en": "Oh la vache.",
  "fr": "Oh la vache."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Talbot",
  "en": "...Got you now.",
  "fr": "...Je te tiens, my dear."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Jeanne",
  "en": "Why!\nWhy are you after the armlet?!",
  "fr": "Pourquoi ?! Pourquoi en voulez-vous\nau Bracelet ?!"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Talbot",
  "en": "Don't ask me.\nI just follow my orders.",
  "fr": "Ne me demande pas.\nJe ne fais qu'obéir aux ordres."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Talbot",
  "en": "Although\\u2014if I might add a \nbit of personal observation\\u2014",
  "fr": "Cela dit\\u2014si je puis me\npermettre une remarque\\u2014"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BM",
  "max": 34,
  "who": "Talbot",
  "en": "killing you sooner than later \nstrikes me as a very good idea!",
  "fr": "te tuer au plus vite me semble\noune excellente idée !"
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BT",
  "max": 16,
  "who": "Gilles",
  "en": "Too late...",
  "fr": "Trop tard..."
 },
 {
  "ctx": "ST1060BT",
